he regulatory chain of TGF-beta, and regulates integrin-dependent activation of TGF-beta."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}